Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 11:13:47 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [M150] [filesystem] Add read-only mode to DirectoryImpl

Original change's description:
> [filesystem] Add read-only mode to DirectoryImpl
>
> DirectoryImpl now takes an AccessMode. In kReadOnly mode, WriteFile,
> Delete, Rename and Replace return FILE_ERROR_SECURITY,
> OpenFileHandle/OpenFileHandles only accept kFlagOpen | kFlagRead,
> OpenDirectory never creates missing directories, and the mode propagates
> through OpenDirectory and Clone.
>
> ZipFileCreator binds its source-directory remote as kReadOnly. The
> file-util utility only enumerates entries and opens existing files for
> reading while building the archive, so it does not need any of the
> mutating operations on the user-selected source folder.
>
> Existing call sites default to kReadWrite and are unaffected.
>
